{"seq":3,"slug":"svg-canvas-comparison","title":"SVG 与 Canvas 对比选型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web3d-visualization/data-visualization/svg-canvas-comparison","wordCount":967,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"svg-与-canvas-对比选型\">SVG 与 Canvas 对比选型</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>SVG 和 Canvas 是 Web 平台上两种根本不同的图形渲染技术。SVG 基于 XML 的矢量图形标准，每个图形元素都是 DOM 节点，支持 CSS 样式和事件绑定；Canvas 提供像素级的 2D 绘图 API，通过 JavaScript 命令式绘制位图。在数据可视化领域，两者各有优势，选型决策直接影响项目的性能、交互能力和维护成本。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[图形渲染需求] --&gt; B{选型决策}&#10;    B --&gt;|元素少+交互多| C[SVG]&#10;    B --&gt;|元素多+性能优先| D[Canvas]&#10;    B --&gt;|矢量输出| C&#10;    B --&gt;|像素操作| D&#10;    C --&gt; E[DOM 元素管理]&#10;    C --&gt; F[CSS 动画]&#10;    C --&gt; G[事件委托]&#10;    D --&gt; H[像素缓冲区]&#10;    D --&gt; I[requestAnimationFrame]&#10;    D --&gt; J[手动命中检测]\">graph TD\n    A[图形渲染需求] --&gt; B{选型决策}\n    B --&gt;|元素少+交互多| C[SVG]\n    B --&gt;|元素多+性能优先| D[Canvas]\n    B --&gt;|矢量输出| C\n    B --&gt;|像素操作| D\n    C --&gt; E[DOM 元素管理]\n    C --&gt; F[CSS 动画]\n    C --&gt; G[事件委托]\n    D --&gt; H[像素缓冲区]\n    D --&gt; I[requestAnimationFrame]\n    D --&gt; J[手动命中检测]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>SVG</th>\n<th>Canvas 2D</th>\n<th>WebGL/WebGPU</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>渲染模型</td>\n<td>保留模式（DOM）</td>\n<td>即时模式（位图）</td>\n<td>即时模式（GPU）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图形元素上限</td>\n<td>~1,000-5,000</td>\n<td>~100,000+</td>\n<td>~1,000,000+</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>事件处理</td>\n<td>原生 DOM 事件</td>\n<td>手动坐标计算</td>\n<td>手动坐标计算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缩放表现</td>\n<td>无损缩放</td>\n<td>重绘或模糊</td>\n<td>无损缩放</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CSS 支持</td>\n<td>完全支持</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>导出/打印</td>\n<td>矢量清晰</td>\n<td>分辨率受限</td>\n<td>需要 readPixels</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存占用</td>\n<td>高（DOM 节点）</td>\n<td>低（像素缓冲）</td>\n<td>中（GPU 缓冲）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可访问性</td>\n<td>支持（aria 属性）</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>理解这两种技术的渲染模型差异是正确选型的关键：SVG 是<strong>保留模式</strong>（retained mode），浏览器维护一棵图形元素树，开发者修改树的属性即可更新画面；Canvas 是<strong>即时模式</strong>（immediate mode），每一帧都从头绘制所有内容，浏览器不记忆之前画了什么。</p>\n<h2 id=\"svg-的优势场景\">SVG 的优势场景</h2><p>SVG 在以下场景中具有不可替代的优势：</p>\n<p><strong>交互密集型可视化</strong>：每个 SVG 元素自带 DOM 事件，无需自己实现命中检测。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const createInteractiveSVG = (container: HTMLElement): void =&gt; {&#10;  const svg = document.createElementNS(&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39;, &#39;svg&#39;);&#10;  svg.setAttribute(&#39;viewBox&#39;, &#39;0 0 800 400&#39;);&#10;&#10;  const rect = document.createElementNS(&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39;, &#39;rect&#39;);&#10;  rect.setAttribute(&#39;x&#39;, &#39;100&#39;);&#10;  rect.setAttribute(&#39;y&#39;, &#39;50&#39;);&#10;  rect.setAttribute(&#39;width&#39;, &#39;200&#39;);&#10;  rect.setAttribute(&#39;height&#39;, &#39;100&#39;);&#10;  rect.classList.add(&#39;interactive-bar&#39;);&#10;&#10;  rect.addEventListener(&#39;mouseenter&#39;, (e) =&gt; {&#10;    const target = e.currentTarget as SVGRectElement;&#10;    target.style.opacity = &#39;0.8&#39;;&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  rect.addEventListener(&#39;click&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;    showTooltip(rect.dataset);&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  svg.appendChild(rect);&#10;  container.appendChild(svg);&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createInteractiveSVG</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">container</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> HTMLElement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> svg</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> document.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createElementNS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'svg'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  svg.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setAttribute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'viewBox'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'0 0 800 400'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> rect</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> document.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createElementNS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'rect'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rect.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setAttribute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'x'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'100'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rect.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setAttribute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'y'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'50'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rect.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setAttribute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'width'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'200'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rect.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setAttribute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'height'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'100'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rect.classList.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'interactive-bar'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rect.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addEventListener</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'mouseenter'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> target</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> e.currentTarget </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SVGRectElement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    target.style.opacity </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '0.8'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rect.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addEventListener</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'click'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    showTooltip</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(rect.dataset);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  svg.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">appendChild</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(rect);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  container.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">appendChild</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(svg);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>高保真输出</strong>：SVG 作为矢量格式，在任意缩放比例下保持清晰，适合报告打印和 PDF 导出。</p>\n<p><strong>CSS 集成</strong>：SVG 元素支持完整的 CSS 选择器、伪类和动画。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const svgStyles = `&#10;  .bar {&#10;    transition: fill 0.3s ease, opacity 0.3s ease;&#10;  }&#10;  .bar:hover {&#10;    opacity: 0.8;&#10;    cursor: pointer;&#10;  }&#10;  .bar.active {&#10;    stroke-width: 2px;&#10;  }&#10;`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> svgStyles</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  .bar {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    transition: fill 0.3s ease, opacity 0.3s ease;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  .bar:hover {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    opacity: 0.8;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    cursor: pointer;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  .bar.active {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    stroke-width: 2px;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"canvas-的优势场景\">Canvas 的优势场景</h2><p>Canvas 在高性能渲染场景中具有压倒性优势：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface Particle {&#10;  x: number;&#10;  y: number;&#10;  vx: number;&#10;  vy: number;&#10;  radius: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const renderParticles = (ctx: CanvasRenderingContext2D, particles: Particle[]): void =&gt; {&#10;  ctx.clearRect(0, 0, ctx.canvas.width, ctx.canvas.height);&#10;&#10;  ctx.fillStyle = &#39;rgba(70, 130, 180, 0.6)&#39;;&#10;  ctx.beginPath();&#10;  for (const p of particles) {&#10;    ctx.moveTo(p.x + p.radius, p.y);&#10;    ctx.arc(p.x, p.y, p.radius, 0, Math.PI * 2);&#10;  }&#10;  ctx.fill();&#10;};&#10;&#10;const animateParticles = (ctx: CanvasRenderingContext2D, particles: Particle[]): void =&gt; {&#10;  const update = () =&gt; {&#10;    for (const p of particles) {&#10;      p.x += p.vx;&#10;      p.y += p.vy;&#10;      if (p.x &lt; 0 || p.x &gt; ctx.canvas.width) p.vx *= -1;&#10;      if (p.y &lt; 0 || p.y &gt; ctx.canvas.height) p.vy *= -1;&#10;    }&#10;    renderParticles(ctx, particles);&#10;    requestAnimationFrame(update);&#10;  };&#10;  update();&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Particle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  x</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  y</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  vx</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  vy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</s